{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BENTO BLOCKS </strong>is a wholesome puzzle game that combines culinary creativity with satisfying, brain-teasing challenges. <i>Slice</i>, <i>arrange</i>, and perfect your delicious lunch boxes at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/efd61bfebca7b75ffd664eb2ae93217f.poster.avif?t=1763451904\" width=1170 height=419 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/efd61bfebca7b75ffd664eb2ae93217f.webm?t=1763451904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/3c317077c8b485d4502d2222c0c74ba6.poster.avif?t=1763451904\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/3c317077c8b485d4502d2222c0c74ba6.webm?t=1763451904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a fresh take on puzzle games as you <strong>slice</strong> and <strong>arrange</strong> ingredients to craft lunch boxes. Each level offers a new recipe, ingredients, and a new way to test your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/c946e3bf58e1a09f81eb554d81560468.poster.avif?t=1763451904\" width=1170 height=351 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/c946e3bf58e1a09f81eb554d81560468.webm?t=1763451904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/162030224115dea40a5a1248ab8585f1.poster.avif?t=1763451904\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/162030224115dea40a5a1248ab8585f1.webm?t=1763451904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play how you like!</strong> Unwind with gentle music, bite-sized challenges and calming visuals. Explore over <strong>100 hand-crafted levels</strong>, each with its own clever twist and satisfying solution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/eb0a1fc4be8e161386a69290a1bdc151.poster.avif?t=1763451904\" width=1170 height=351 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/eb0a1fc4be8e161386a69290a1bdc151.webm?t=1763451904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/f4efd734c4f66aa16ad9774ab767bcd3.poster.avif?t=1763451904\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/f4efd734c4f66aa16ad9774ab767bcd3.webm?t=1763451904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fewer cuts mean more stars for your <strong>recipe book</strong>... but it might not be so <i>shrimple</i> after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/59bab3857df03f2fda4c5020d13fbe45.poster.avif?t=1763451904\" width=1170 height=351 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/59bab3857df03f2fda4c5020d13fbe45.webm?t=1763451904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize cute, <i>hand-drawn ingredients</i> into a variety of bento boxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fewer slices you make, the more stars you'll earn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new chapters and scenery as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax with a cozy soundtrack and soothing visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/6e546e0f36cae59f67bfeb5ca8e5ad6e.poster.avif?t=1763451904\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/6e546e0f36cae59f67bfeb5ca8e5ad6e.webm?t=1763451904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank you for reading! Support us by <u>wish-listing</u> the game and join our cozy community on <u>Discord!</u></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3311670